            "description_html": "<b>Drive-in Deadlatch for Weslock Entry Door Levers</b>\r\n<p>\r\nDrive-in type Deadlatch for Weslock Keyed Entry <b>Door Levers</b>. Deadlatches are used with doors levers that have a lock cylinder in the lever.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/door-lever-drive-in-springlatch-for-weslock\">Weslock Drive-in Spring Latch</a> for Passage or Privacy function door levers.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWeslock 600 series. For use with <a href=\"/collections/weslock-molten-bronze-collection\">Weslock Molton Bronze Series</a>, <a href=\"/collections/weslock-elegance-collection\">Weslock Elegance Series</a> and <a href=\"/collections/weslock-traditionale-collection\">Weslock Traditional Collection</a>, <b>Door Levers</b> (not door knobs) and <b>Entry Handles with Door Levers</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Note: </b>If you have a Weslock keyed entry Door Knob use, <a href=\"/products/door-knob-drive-in-deadlatch-for-weslock\">Weslock Door Knob Drive-in Deadlatch</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAdjustable  for both 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\" backsets. <br>\r\nDrive-in type latch (*Does NOT use a faceplate).\r\n</p>",
